        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "788b2c07-42d9-5418-8cf0-1b57a289524e",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Catherine O'Hara, Charlie Tahan, Winona Ryder, Martin Short, Christopher Guest\n- Films: Frankenweenie, Beetlejuice, Edward Scissorhands, The Nightmare Before Christmas, Mars Attacks!, After Hours, Home Alone, Waiting for Guffman, Best in Show, A Mighty Wind, For Your Consideration\n- Television: Second City Television, Ozark\n- Roles: Victor Frankenstein\n\nFacts:\n- Catherine Anne O'Hara was born on March 4, 1954, and she is a Canadian-American actress, writer, and comedian.\n- Catherine O'Hara was known for comedy work on Second City Television from 1976 to 1984.\n- Catherine O'Hara appeared in the films After Hours in 1985, Beetlejuice in 1988, Home Alone in 1990, and The Nightmare Before Christmas in 1993.\n- Catherine O'Hara also appeared in Christopher Guest's mockumentary films Waiting for Guffman in 1996, Best in Show in 2000, A Mighty Wind in 2003, and For Your Consideration in 2006.\n- Charlie Tahan was born on June 11, 1998, and he is an American actor.\n- Charlie Tahan is known for playing Wyatt on Ozark and for voicing Victor Frankenstein in the animated film Frankenweenie.\n- The 2012 film Frankenweenie included voice cast members Winona Ryder, Catherine O'Hara, and Martin Short, who had each previously worked with Tim Burton on earlier films.\n- Winona Ryder had previously worked with Tim Burton on Beetlejuice and Edward Scissorhands, Catherine O'Hara had previously worked with him on Beetlejuice and The Nightmare Before Christmas, and Martin Short had previously worked with him on Mars Attacks!.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
